le":"Improve accuracy and productivity by extracting licensing data from contracts and generating software entitlements","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/extract-entitlements-from-contracts-now-assist-sam.md","line":67},{"title":"Benefit with an integrated troubleshooting experience for SaaS applications by resolving common issues using automated guidance","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/troubleshooting-saas-now-assist-sam.md","line":71},{"title":"Use an agentic workflow to automate Microsoft 365 license assignment to users to improve efficiency","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/now-assist-sam-fulfill-sw-asset-requests-workflow.md","line":75},{"title":"Software Asset Management integration with Contract Management Pro","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/sam-integration-cmpro.md","line":79},{"title":"Improve user activity tracking with the GitHub integration","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/integrate-with-github.md","line":84},{"title":"Enhanced integration with OpenLM for tracking subscription and consumption licenses","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/concurrent-licenses.md","line":88},{"title":"Leverage machine learning \\(ML\\) normalization for managing your software assets in protected government environments","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/ml-learning-sam.md","line":92},{"title":"Enhance the security of SAP ABAP on-premise integration using OAuth 2.0 authentication","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/add-sap-connection.md","line":96},{"title":"Improve your license management experience through the enhanced support for Oracle WebLogic Suite licensing","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/oracle-licensing-cloud-environments.md","line":100},{"title":"Improve software normalization outcomes with expanded pattern-based normalization rules rule","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/c_SAMDiscovery.md","line":104},{"title":"Enhanced SQL server enterprise edition license compliance to support Server/CAL licensing model","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/mapping-ms-license-metrics.md","line":108},{"title":"Generate optimal software lifecycle reports using a guided playbook that ensures adherence to compliance and audit requirements.","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/guidedplaybook-sw-lifecycle-reports.md","line":112},{"title":"Streamline license management for Microsoft server product Installations and license usage via a single report","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/device-license-consumption-report.md","line":116},{"title":"Troubleshoot button alongside the error message on the Integration profile form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/troubleshooting-saas-now-assist-sam.md","line":123},{"title":"Delete button on the Product Workload Mapping form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/integrate-with-crowdstrike.md","line":128},{"title":"Product workload mappings and breakdown data lists on the License operations view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/operations-workspace.md","line":132},{"title":"Engineering application licenses, usages, and denials lists on the License operations view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/operations-workspace.md","line":136},{"title":"Granular configuration admin roles","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/sam-installed-components.md","line":143},{"title":"ServiceNow Store","target":"https://store.servicenow.com/store","line":167},{"title":"ServiceNow Store version history release notes","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/bundle/store-release-notes/page/release-notes/store/sn-store-release-notes.html","line":167},{"title":"AI Agent Studio","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/ai-agent-studio.md","line":178},{"title":"Now Assist skills","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/now-assist-skills.md","line":182},{"title":"Hardware Asset Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/ham-landing-page.md","line":186},{"title":"Enterprise Asset Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/enterprise-asset-management.md","line":190},{"title":"Cloud Cost Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/cloud-insights-landing-page.md","line":194},{"title":"Contract Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/c_ContractManagement.md","line":198},{"title":"Procurement","target":"https://raw.githubuse